WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.165 --> 00:00:09.198
Restore the White Rabbit hourly contract and give the client a billing email (both reverted at the end)

2
00:00:09.198 --> 00:00:17.360
Log 30 minutes of MSP time on shared White Rabbit ticket 000016, dated Oct 18 (inside the invoiced October period)

3
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:56.380
Create a native White Rabbit ticket and log 30 minutes of native time on it, also dated Oct 18

4
00:00:56.380 --> 00:01:17.331
Approve through native timesheets: a disposable approver team led by QA, submit the Oct 12-18 sheet, approve it

5
00:01:17.331 --> 00:01:33.141
Automatic Invoices: the November service period of the hourly line now carries the late October time

6
00:01:33.141 --> 00:01:38.594
Open the disposable draft: both lines say which October period they belong to

7
00:01:38.594 --> 00:01:48.950
Retry: nothing is offered twice, and the closed October window cannot be regenerated
